SUMMARY:Stand-Up Showcase
LOCATION:DC Improv\, 1140 Connecticut Avenue NW\, Washington
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy great stand-up comedy in downtown DC. Our showcase lineup
 s feature top talent from DC\, Maryland\, Virginia and beyond\, performing 
 on one of the country's most famous stages. You'll see a variety of styles 
 and get up close with some of the stars of tomorrow. Support local talent\,
  support local business and (most important) laugh your a** off. Showcases 
 generally last around 90 minutes.\n\nOctober 9-11 lineup: John Jacobs\, Den
 ise Taylor\, Randy Syphax\, Bob Holden\n\nOctober 16-18 lineup: Anthony Oak
 es\, Joey Duffied\, Abe Gatling\, Prince Arora\, Amber Hendrix\n\nOctober 3
 0 - November 1 lineup: Stacey Axler\, Cerrome Russell\, Mike Lebovitz\, App
 le Brown Betty\n\nNovember 13-15 lineup: Matilda Epstein\, Ontonio Kareem\,
  Dale Dunlap\, Jose Raymond\n\nAll sales are final. Refunds and exchanges a
 re offered only when a show is canceled or rescheduled.\n\nAdmission Polici
 es\n\nPatrons must be 18 or older to attend events or classes at the DC Imp
 rov. Any exceptions are clearly noted in the event descriptions.\n\nThere i
 s a two-item minimum per customer. This can be any combination of food item
 s or beverages. Bottled water and soft drinks count as items. (The two-item
  minimum does not apply to comedy classes.)\n\nCoupons or passes for free a
 dmission cannot be used for a show listed as a "special event."\n\nSeating 
 Policies\n\nAll shows in our lounge showroom are seated by time of arrival.
  The earlier you arrive\, the more options you'll have. Please note that th
 e size of your party can affect what options are available to you\, as cert
 ain tables and areas are designated for larger parties.\n\nFor general admi
 ssion tickets\, if your party does not fill an entire table\, you may be sh
 aring a table with other patrons.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comed
 y-atlas/event/stand-up-showcase-58880/
